        "proposal_id": "kt27__openai",
        "chunk_index": 1,
        "char_start": 1400,
        "char_end": 3200
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Kora is powered by conversational AI and agentic automation, which adds complexity to its software development.",
      "dimensions": [
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "feasibility",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt27__openai",
        "chunk_index": 1,
        "char_start": 1400,
        "char_end": 3200
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The plan includes small-batch production first to identify and resolve issues early in the manufacturing process.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "risk",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt27__openai",
        "chunk_index": 1,
        "char_start": 1400,
        "char_end": 3200
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Shipping large tech products like Kora globally can encounter unexpected delays.",
      "dimensions": [
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "feasibility",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt27__openai",
        "chunk_index": 2,
        "char_start": 2800,
        "char_end": 4600
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Kora will keep backers updated with full transparency on timelines and milestones.",
      "dimensions": [
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "feasibility",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt27__openai",
        "chunk_index": 2,
        "char_start": 2800,
        "char_end": 4600
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Some advanced features for Kora may evolve based on user feedback.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "strategy",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "market",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt27__openai",
        "chunk_index": 2,
        "char_start": 2800,
        "char_end": 4600
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Kora will share a clear development timeline and involve backers in shaping future releases.",
      "dimensions": [
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "feasibility",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt27__openai",
        "chunk_index": 2,
        "char_start": 2800,
        "char_end": 4600
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The project seeks funding for AI technology.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "strategy",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "market",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt27__openai",
        "chunk_index": 2,
        "char_start": 2800,
        "char_end": 4600
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Consent from individuals whose works or information are incorporated into the project has been obtained.",
      "dimensions": [
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "feasibility",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt27__openai",
        "chunk_index": 2,
        "char_start": 2800,
        "char_end": 4600
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "There will be an opt-in or opt-out for the owners of the works or information used in the project.",
      "dimensions": [
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "feasibility",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt27__openai",
        "chunk_index": 2,
        "char_start": 2800,
        "char_end": 4600
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Kora AI runs on-device, agentic AI models to help families coordinate schedules, reminders, shopping lists, and smart-home automations.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "strategy",
        "innovation",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "product",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt27__openai",
        "chunk_index": 3,
        "char_start": 4200,
        "char_end": 6000
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The project is developing AI technology that powers Kora, including natural-language understanding, task-planning, and personalized reminder engines.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "strategy",
        "innovation",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "product",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt27__openai",
        "chunk_index": 3,
        "char_start": 4200,
        "char_end": 6000
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Training data for Kora AI comes from a mix of publicly available, open-license datasets and proprietary data created in-house.",
      "dimensions": [
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "resource",
      "primary_dimension": "feasibility",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt27__openai",
        "chunk_index": 3,
        "char_start": 4200,
        "char_end": 6000
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "No copyrighted works or personal data are used without explicit, prior consent.",
      "dimensions": [
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "feasibility",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt27__openai",
        "chunk_index": 3,
        "char_start": 4200,
        "char_end": 6000
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "All future user data remains local to the device by default; users must opt-in before any data leaves the home for model improvement.",
      "dimensions": [
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "mitigation",
      "primary_dimension": "feasibility",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt27__openai",
        "chunk_index": 3,
        "char_start": 4200,
        "char_end": 6000
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Every data source licensed or created for Kora AI is documented, and owners/creators will receive credit in the user guide and on the website.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "strategy",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "market",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt27__openai",
        "chunk_index": 3,
        "char_start": 4200,
        "char_end": 6000
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The project provides a straightforward opt-in/opt-out mechanism for any third-party rights-holders whose material could be incorporated.",
      "dimensions": [
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "feasibility",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt27__openai",
        "chunk_index": 3,
        "char_start": 4200,
        "char_end": 6000
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Kora's AI is functional, providing task planning, reminders, and speech recognition.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "strategy",
        "innovation",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "product",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt27__openai",
        "chunk_index": 3,
        "char_start": 4200,
        "char_end": 6000
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Funding is needed to cover hardware tooling and the first manufacturing run.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "strategy",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "market",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt27__openai",
        "chunk_index": 4,
        "char_start": 5600,
        "char_end": 7400
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Funding will also support continued R&D for on-device agentic AI, focusing on privacy-preserving optimization, latency reduction, and accessibility features.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "strategy",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "mitigation",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt27__openai",
        "chunk_index": 4,
        "char_start": 5600,
        "char_end": 7400
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Open-source compliance reviews and third-party license fees are also part of the funding needs.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "strategy",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "market",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt27__openai",
        "chunk_index": 4,
        "char_start": 5600,
        "char_end": 7400
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The project is currently 107% funded on Kickstarter.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "strategy",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "market",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "suspect_numeric": false,
        "proposal_id": "kt27__openai",
        "chunk_index": 4,
        "char_start": 5600,
        "char_end": 7400
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The project has 10 days left for funding on Kickstarter.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "strategy",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "market",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "suspect_numeric": false,
        "proposal_id": "kt27__openai",
        "chunk_index": 4,
